<title>USA: ATC extends expiration date of warrants.</title>
<headline>ATC extends expiration date of warrants.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATC Group Services Inc said Thursday that the expiration date of its class C common stock purchase warrants has been extended to the close of business, April 30.</p>
</text>
